"Exercise - Actionable only by designated exercise participants; exercise "
"identifier SHOULD appear in note"
msgstr ""
"Zoezi - Inaweza kutekelezwa tu na washiriki walioteuliwa wa mazoezi; "
"kitambulisho cha zoezi LAZIMA kionekane kwenye dokezo"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:168
msgid "System - For messages that support alert network internal functions"
msgstr "Mfumo - Kwa ujumbe unaoauni vitendaji vya ndani vya arifa"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:172
msgid "Alert - Initial information requiring attention by targeted recipients"
msgstr ""
"Tahadhari - Taarifa ya awali inayohitaji kushughulikiwa na wapokeaji lengwa"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:173
msgid ""
"Update - Updates and supersedes the earlier message(s) identified in "
"referenced alerts"
msgstr ""
"Sasisha - Inasasisha na kuchukua nafasi ya ujumbe wa awali uliotambuliwa "
"katika arifa zilizorejelewa"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:174
msgid "Cancel - Cancels the earlier message(s) identified in references"
msgstr "Ghairi - Hughairi ujumbe wa awali uliotambuliwa katika marejeleo"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:185
msgid "Public - For general dissemination to unrestricted audiences"
msgstr "Umma - Kwa usambazaji wa jumla kwa hadhira isiyo na kikomo"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:186
msgid ""
"Restricted - For dissemination only to users with a known operational "
"requirement as in the restriction field"
msgstr ""
"Imezuiliwa - Kwa usambazaji tu kwa watumiaji walio na hitaji la kufanya kazi"
" linalojulikana kama katika uga wa vizuizi"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:188
msgid ""
"Private - For dissemination only to specified addresses as in the addresses "
"field in the alert"
msgstr ""
"Faragha - Kwa usambazaji tu kwa anwani maalum kama katika sehemu ya anwani "
"katika tahadhari"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:191
msgid "Id"
msgstr "Kitambulisho"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:192
msgid "Unique ID. Auto generated on creation."
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha kipekee. Imetengenezwa kiotomatiki kwenye uundaji."

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:193
msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Mtumaji"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:194
msgid ""
"Identifies the originator of an alert. For example the website address of "
"the institution"
msgstr ""
"Hubainisha mwanzilishi wa arifa. Kwa mfano anwani ya tovuti ya taasisi"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:196
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Imetumwa"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:197
msgid ""
"Time and date of origination of the alert. Automatically generated by the "
"system during publishing"
msgstr ""
"Wakati na tarehe ya asili ya arifa. Imetolewa kiotomatiki na mfumo wakati wa"
" uchapishaji"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:199
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Hali"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:200
msgid "The code denoting the appropriate handling of the alert"
msgstr "Msimbo unaoashiria utunzaji unaofaa wa tahadhari"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:202
msgid "Message Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Ujumbe"

#: capcomposer/src/capcomposer/capeditor/models.py:203
